WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.032
- If this works,

00:00:02.032 --> 00:00:04.365
sign me up for the Olympics.

00:00:07.481 --> 00:00:09.589
Okay, so today, I'm gonna be making a

00:00:09.589 --> 00:00:11.714
giant chocolate Easter egg,

00:00:11.714 --> 00:00:14.924
one of my favorite things
to eat on Easter morning.

00:00:14.924 --> 00:00:16.844
First, I'm just gonna
melt down the chocolate.

00:00:16.844 --> 00:00:19.048
I'm using semi-sweet chocolate.

00:00:19.048 --> 00:00:21.974
I'll use two bags for now, and we'll see.

00:00:21.974 --> 00:00:23.610
Maybe we need more.

00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:26.597
When you're melting chocolate,
it burns super quickly.

00:00:26.597 --> 00:00:31.063
So, I'm just gonna do one
minute intervals and stir it,

00:00:31.063 --> 00:00:34.571
and keep doing that
until it's melted down.

00:00:34.571 --> 00:00:37.391
The coconut oil will also help
with setting the chocolate

00:00:37.391 --> 00:00:40.120
into the egg shape too,
so I think it's just like

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:43.965
a win-win situation to
use the coconut oil.

00:00:43.965 --> 00:00:45.850
The chocolate seems like
a nice consistency that'll

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:49.333
just spread around the balloon,
so I'm hopeful about that.

00:00:49.333 --> 00:00:53.166
Now, we have our bottle
filled with chocolate.

00:00:56.390 --> 00:00:58.054
I'm gonna overcompensate
a little, because I know

00:00:58.054 --> 00:00:58.887
I'm gonna lose-

00:00:58.887 --> 00:01:01.387
oh, I'm a little light-headed.

00:01:03.416 --> 00:01:04.844
Woo!

00:01:04.844 --> 00:01:07.972
I'm gonna twist it to create
kind of a seal before I try

00:01:07.972 --> 00:01:11.305
to snap this around this squeeze bottle.

00:01:13.951 --> 00:01:15.595
Oh!

00:01:15.595 --> 00:01:16.428
Dang it.

00:01:17.317 --> 00:01:20.900
I have, like, a phobia
of balloons popping.

00:01:22.261 --> 00:01:24.094
Just so you know that.

00:01:25.666 --> 00:01:28.932
This is the perfect
thing for me to be doing.

00:01:28.932 --> 00:01:30.381
I will own the risk.

00:01:30.381 --> 00:01:33.048
Because this is like, do or die.

00:01:34.246 --> 00:01:35.735
Let's flip this.

00:01:35.735 --> 00:01:37.047
Oh!

00:01:37.047 --> 00:01:37.880
Okay.

00:01:39.447 --> 00:01:41.122
Something's happening.

00:01:41.122 --> 00:01:44.539
Definitely I'm gonna need more chocolate.

00:01:46.551 --> 00:01:49.521
So, there is a chance I
can't do this, by the way.

00:01:49.521 --> 00:01:52.037
So, I'm gonna maybe tilt it this way.

00:01:52.037 --> 00:01:54.731
So hard to tell where it needs to go.

00:01:54.731 --> 00:01:57.310
I'm just gonna roll it around a lot.

00:01:57.310 --> 00:02:00.557
I feel like this is like,
Tetris or something.

00:02:00.557 --> 00:02:02.260
My god, I think I did it.

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:05.843
If this works, sign me
up for the Olympics.

00:02:06.959 --> 00:02:10.068
This should work as like a little nest.

00:02:10.068 --> 00:02:12.520
The inside is chocolate!

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:15.034
I'm gonna freeze it,
this is a better freezer.

00:02:15.034 --> 00:02:18.218
30 minutes, and I'll check on
it, see if it's like solid,

00:02:18.218 --> 00:02:21.684
because coconut oil helps
chocolate set super quickly.

00:02:21.684 --> 00:02:24.303
So, it shouldn't take too long.

00:02:24.303 --> 00:02:25.753
We'll see, stay tuned.

00:02:25.753 --> 00:02:28.780
It's pretty hard, so I'm happy with that.

00:02:28.780 --> 00:02:31.995
So, I'm just gonna cut the balloon now,

00:02:31.995 --> 00:02:34.370
and hopefully peel it off.

00:02:34.370 --> 00:02:35.287
Okay, here.

00:02:36.219 --> 00:02:38.552
Wow, that was so satisfying!

00:02:40.643 --> 00:02:43.110
Yeah, it's definitely more of a round egg.

00:02:43.110 --> 00:02:45.159
Not a great decorator.

00:02:45.159 --> 00:02:47.744
Let's get that out there first.

00:02:47.744 --> 00:02:49.890
This is pretty fun though, I have to say.

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:51.473
Oh, a little messy.

00:02:52.543 --> 00:02:55.296
I feel like I'm just trolling this egg.

00:02:55.296 --> 00:02:57.061
Should do some sprinkles.

00:02:57.061 --> 00:03:01.341
All right, I think that
concludes the decorating portion.

00:03:01.341 --> 00:03:02.314
Do you like it?

00:03:02.314 --> 00:03:03.945
Happy Easter!

00:03:03.945 --> 00:03:06.423
Well, looks like Easter
just threw up all over

00:03:06.423 --> 00:03:08.012
this chocolate egg.

00:03:08.012 --> 00:03:12.191
Tune in next time for
another Super Mega Challenge.

00:03:12.191 --> 00:03:13.024
Oh yes!

